sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24948378/MRP.zip)\n\n### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.6 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated GeForce 920M - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-5005U CPU @ 2.00GHz (4 threads) - 11.91 ГиБ memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot version:\n4.6.stable\nPreviously working in:\n4.5.stable.mono\nAfter upgrading my project from Godot 4.5 to 4.6, the entire rendering pipeline appears to be broken.\n\nLighting that was carefully tuned over weeks is now completely destroyed.\nThe same scenes, same assets, same settings produce drastically worse results in 4.6.\n\nIssues observed:\n- VoxelGI lighting is broken (incorrect light propagation, dirty and overexposed results)\n- SDFGI quality is significantly degraded compared to 4.5\n- Built-in sky shaders render incorrectly\n- Environment lighting no longer behaves as expected\n- Overall global illumination and scene balance are completely off\n\nThis upgrade fully broke my previously finished and polished lighting setup.\nNo materials, shaders, or scene logic were changed during the upgrade.\n\nExpected result:\nRendering output in Godot 4.6 should match or closely resemble the visual quality of Godot 4.5\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a617b9e-6d3f-4b51-8d5e-ad14f19ddf82\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76904946-7d31-4ab1-9459-0404b7f55805\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35d89e95-5e5d-43e1-ab4d-b9db37ef06fe\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/29e8e0af-72bd-4a9b-bacf-e3ed92aaaa79\" />\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d4c96bb-dcd4-48dd-bbe8-6da7b58e1aa7\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the same project or scene in Godot 4.5.stable.\n2. Observe correct lighting, global illumination (VoxelGI / SDFGI) and sky/environment shaders.\n3. Open the same project in Godot 4.6.stable without changing any settings, assets or materials.\n4. Observe broken lighting, incorrect VoxelGI and SDFGI behavior, and visually broken built-in sky shaders.\n5. Compare the visual result between 4.5 and 4.6 (see attached screenshots).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI’ve attached an MVP prototype of the project for review.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115599/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_r